# Tailwind CSS Conventions

## General
- Use Tailwind utility classes exclusively — no CSS modules, no styled-components
- Mobile-first responsive design: default = mobile, `sm:` `md:` `lg:` for larger
- Use `className` template literals for conditional classes
- Prefer `clsx` or `cn` utility for conditional class merging

## Color Palette (Family Manager)
- Primary: blue-600 / blue-700
- Success: green-500 / green-600
- Warning: amber-500 / amber-600
- Danger: red-500 / red-600
- Background: gray-50 (light) / gray-900 (dark)
- Card: white / gray-800 (dark)

## Spacing & Layout
- Use consistent spacing: `p-4`, `gap-4`, `space-y-4`
- Cards: `rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-4`
- Max content width: `max-w-md mx-auto` (mobile-optimized PWA)
- Use Flexbox (`flex`) for 1D layouts, Grid (`grid`) for 2D

## Dark Mode
- Prepare classes with `dark:` prefix from R1
- Store preference in Dexie settings table
- Apply via `class="dark"` on `<html>` element

## Accessibility
- Minimum touch target: `min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px]`
- Focus states: `focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:outline-none`
- Color contrast: ensure WCAG AA minimum
